+## 如何复验
+```
+# GET https://api.github.com/repos/crmne/spotifast/releases/latest → v0.13.1（2026-10-14）
+# 挂载 spotifast-v0.13.1-macos-universal.dmg → rocks.spotifast.Spotifast / 0.13.1 / Team JPL7999US3 / Notarized
+swift run --package-path application-test feed-discover spotifast-v0.13.1-macos-universal.dmg
+#   → Spotifast [rocks.spotifast.Spotifast] 0.13.1 — no Sparkle and no electron-builder update config
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify spotifast-v0.13.1-macos-universal.dmg --expect stable
+#   → detected stable, winning source GitHub, latest 0.13.1, status up to date
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify spotifast-v0.13.0-macos-universal.dmg --expect stable
+#   → detected stable, winning source GitHub, latest 0.13.1, status UPDATE → 0.13.1
+# 旧 id（me.paolino.fastpotify）：三份真包都读到 GitHub 的答案
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify spotifast-v0.9.1-macos-universal.dmg --expect stable
+#   → bundle id me.paolino.fastpotify, detected stable, winning source GitHub, latest 0.13.1, status UPDATE → 0.13.1
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify spotifast-v0.8.0-macos-universal.dmg --expect stable      # 同上
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify fastpotify-v0.7.1-macos-universal.dmg --expect stable    # 同上（ad-hoc，一键被拒）
+```
